   "normal output behavior in the event of a Communication\n"
   "Status change.  These events include all states where\n"
   "the module is without an I/O connection in the run state.\n"
   "This can happen if the I/O connection does not exist, \n"
   "has timed out, has been deleted, or is currently idle.\n"
   "The default is Disabled.  For more details, consult the\n"
   "product documentation.",
